            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Air care has always been essential to wellness. With the Dreamwell™ Humidifier, we take air care a step further—introducing aroma as part of a more complete<strong> </strong>sensory wellness experience.</p><p>For the first time, clean air doesn’t just support how you breathe—it supports how you feel.</p><h3><strong>The Evolution of Air Wellness</strong></h3><p>Dreamwell combines clean air, balanced humidity, and subtle aroma to create a calm, consistent indoor environment. Instead of overpowering fragrance, aroma is delivered gently and continuously, supporting daily and nightly rituals like sleep, focus, and recovery.</p><p>This approach reflects a new way of thinking about air wellness—one that goes beyond function and into feeling.</p>",
