            "richtext": "<h3><strong>Thoughtfully Designed Aroma Collections</strong></h3><p>The aroma collection is available in two curated options, each designed to support different moments of the day:</p><ul><li><strong>The Serenity Collection (Light and Clarity)<br/></strong> Crafted to restore calm and balance, helping you wind down, relax, and ease into rest.<br/><br/></li><li><strong>The Awakening Collection (Calm and Dream)<br/></strong> Designed to uplift your space while supporting focus, clarity, and a refreshed start to the day.</li></ul><p>Each scent is subtle, consistent, and designed specifically to optimize balanced air—never overpowering, always intentional.</p>",
